      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Having my refresh rate set to 120, I've been in a the old hub with one other person and was getting 120fps. I definitely noticed it and was able to take some time to appreciate it. This is unlikely to occur on worlds that have more than 2 or 3 players unless their avatars are super optimized.\n\nAs it stands, the answer to your question is that a limit is not currently in place and I believe this request can be closed.\n\nWith an i7-8700k and a GTX 1080, I still struggle to get 60+ in most instances, but this is something I've grown accustomed to long ago. Performance improvements will ultimately be a join effort between both devs and users.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
